<http://data.silknow.org/object/0ec5d456-493b-3b51-9fba-91c39b1b0244>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Fragment, made up of three pieces stitched together. Copperplate engraving, printed in brown on cotton cloth. Piece does not show complete repeat. At upper left, in a landscape setting with a domed hut in the background, two boys hold up a large hoop while a third boy runs at them from the right. At very bottom, head and shoulders of two boys; in the background, a clump of poplar-like trees in a fenced enclosure. Between these motifs, trees and flying birds; an owl perches on a branch at upper right. Cotton discolored; small holes and tears."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/e9327731-a006-3111-bdcb-fbd1ed9d31d3> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/1bdf25d2-e292-3cae-a505-bd603659f04f> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Fragment, made up of three pieces stitched together. Copperplate engraving, printed in brown on cotton cloth. Piece does not show complete repeat. At upper left, in a landscape setting with a domed hut in the background, two boys hold up a large hoop while a third boy runs at them from the right. At very bottom, head and shoulders of two boys; in the background, a clump of poplar-like trees in a fenced enclosure. Between these motifs, trees and flying birds; an owl perches on a branch at upper right. Cotton discolored; small holes and tears."@en ;
